  "story": {
    "day": 112,
    "title": "Kaya's Evening Thoughts",
    "sentences": [
      "Kaya sat in her lonely bedroom, where she would often read a story.",
      "\"Dinner!\" Mom called from the dining room.",
      "They ate fun Italian pasta.",
      "\"Would you like barley tea?\" Mom asked.",
      "\"Yeah, sure,\" Kaya replied with laughter.",
      "She went to brush her teeth in the bathroom.",
      "Kaya thought of a circus witch flying around.",
      "She felt sick but knew she can't skate away from every battle.",
      "Whose message was this for the world?",
      "Someday, she would volunteer to make a difference.",
      "This idea was her medicine, a quiet order to get to sleep.",
      "She left her worries in the corner of her mind."
    ]
  }
